  "content": "<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wishful-recipes\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/91/a0/caG03Acz_o.png\" alt=\"此模組已整合至 Wishful Recipes。請點擊此處查看。它可以動態生成配方，意味著它與其他模組高度兼容且需要較少的配置\"/></a>\n<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tCzyIk8.png\" alt=\"Title\"/></h1>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mars_\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Support me on ko-fi\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craft-better\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/483633?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-crafting\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/better-crafting?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">此模組調整並添加了一些製作配方以達到更平衡和實用的效果。</p></center>\n<p><strong>板塊轉為方塊</strong> - 重複使用不再需要的木板<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craft-slabs-back-into-blocks\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJNcAtK.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"152\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>在 Blast Furnace 中燒燬砂</strong> - 將沙子和紅沙熔鍊為玻璃<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smelting-sand-in-blast-furnace\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aqTJhBa.png\" width=\"218\" height=\"160\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>烤紅蘿蔔</strong> - 普通的紅蘿蔔，但食用速度加倍<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooked-carrots\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6fhdFom.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"118\" /></a></p>\n<strong>製作 6 個階梯而非 4 個</strong> - 在工作台製作階梯與用石匠台製作的數量相同<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craft-6-stairs-not-4\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CuHq65H.png\" width=\"284\" height=\"158\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>使用黑曜石與末地石製作石頭工具</strong><br />\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jSFGp4x.png\" width=\"263\" height=\"144\" /></p>\n<p><strong>下界岩塊轉為下界 wart</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-wart-block-to-nether-warts\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8XbNbev.png\" width=\"229\" height=\"127\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Blasting Netherrack 轉變為下界磚塊</strong><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-netherrack-into-nether-bricks\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PvwfdMc.png\" width=\"229\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Basting Raw Metal Blocks 轉為方塊</strong> - 在 Blast Furnace 中熔鍊生鐵、青銅和金方塊<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-raw-metal-blocks-into-blocks-fabric-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/addJ4gp.png\" width=\"229\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Blasting黏土</strong> - 將黏土方塊熔鍊為陶瓦方塊，並將黏土球熔鍊為磚塊<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MaKUfMq.png\" width=\"229\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Blasting 圓石</strong> - 將圓石熔鍊為石方塊，將深層石板熔鍊為深層石板<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabric\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3AZgu2.png\" width=\"229\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://mars-the-planet.github.io/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/a1a13adf-7c67-48f1-8d6e-e08334434df1.png\"/></a></p>",
